The SNI-spoofing carrier reimplements a DPI-bypass technique first described by
patterniha (https://github.com/patterniha/SNI-Spoofing) and implemented in Rust
by therealaleph (https://github.com/therealaleph/sni-spoofing-rust, MIT). The Go
code here is original; the fake ClientHello it sends follows the shape that
implementation established.

