smux — internal/thirdparty/smux (a modified copy)
https://github.com/xtaci/smux v1.5.57, MIT licence

The PCK engine multiplexes forwarded connections with smux, built from a copy
kept in this repository (go.mod replaces the module with it) because two things
in it had to change: a window update is sent by a goroutine of its own instead
of by the Read that triggered it, and control frames (window updates, stream
opens, pings) go ahead of data in the write queue instead of waiting for their
stream's turn in the round robin. The wire format is unchanged. The changes are
marked in stream.go and shaper.go. The upstream licence is in
